{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Fishing Pro Simulator, cast your line, sit back, and enjoy the peaceful sounds of nature. Relax, explore, and master the art of fishing. Time your pull just right to reel in the biggest catch of the month!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517550/extras/d3dd30ebc2597e48141c908b62f33bbf.webp?t=1757336894\" width=200 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517550/extras/816e0c7ad678b54bd18743e2400e4b1d.poster.avif?t=1757336894\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517550/extras/816e0c7ad678b54bd18743e2400e4b1d.webm?t=1757336894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517550/extras/816e0c7ad678b54bd18743e2400e4b1d.mp4?t=1757336894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Fishing Pro Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fishing Pro Simulator, grab your rod, pick your bait, and head to the lake for a relaxing fishing trip. Watch the water, stay patient, and pull fast to reel in a big catch. With over 20 fish species, every cast is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517550/extras/de381a899c5efbc010a14e529b5ccedf.webp?t=1757336894\" width=275 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517550/extras/7dfb98b17f4110d1c198561f97ff01de.poster.avif?t=1757336894\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517550/extras/7dfb98b17f4110d1c198561f97ff01de.webm?t=1757336894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517550/extras/7dfb98b17f4110d1c198561f97ff01de.mp4?t=1757336894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different fishing spots, try new bait, and adapt to changing weather. Whether you're here to unwind or test your skills, the lake is waiting. Cast your line and see what you can catch!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517550?t=1757336894","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517550?t=1757336894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517550/95ba9c12469c45352184b0e433c14b44f604f4ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757336894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517550/95ba9c12469c45352184b0e433c14b44f604f4ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757336894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Fishing Pro Simulator</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517550/extras/df4a22b49510334c0173488ed98eb13e.avif?t=1757336894\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Fishing Pro Simulator, cast your line, sit back, and enjoy the peaceful sounds of nature. Relax, explore, and master the art of fishing. Time your pull just right to reel in the biggest catch of the month!</strong></p